/-!
# KFX §7: `RowUP`, the uniform Lemma 13 row addition

`rowCodeU q` (over `l12prog`) implements `Pm i j` in `SImplQ` form for every admissible parameter
set read from the background registers `36 … 45` (`rowQ`).  The Lemma 13 cost `⌈bnd⌉` plus the
